! A fixture, not a dictionary. The words a frame goes around, and the units that
! are not a word at all: one that joins into the word before it, one that writes
! nothing, and a two-stroke entry over a frame's own stroke.

HAOEUR	here
KAT	cat
TWA	two words
SKWR	s[ATTACH_L]
PHRO	[CMD=plover.suggestions][END]
TPR/KAT	tractor
